## Stay Informed

### Release Notifications

Stay up to date with new releases:

```bash
# Check for updates
pika sync --dry-run

# See what's new
cat .pika-sync.json | grep pikaVersion
```

Visit the [Releases](/platform/releases/) page for:
- Latest version information
- [Changelog](/platform/releases/changelog/) with detailed changes
- [Migration Guides](/platform/releases/migration-guides/) for breaking changes

### Watch the Repository

Get notifications for new releases and important updates:

1. Visit [github.com/rithum/pika](https://github.com/rithum/pika)
2. Click "Watch" → "Custom" → Select "Releases"

---

## Community Projects

### Share Your Project

Built something with Pika? We'd love to hear about it!

Share your project on [GitHub Discussions](https://github.com/rithum/pika/discussions) with:
- Description of what you built
- Screenshots or demo links
- Challenges you faced
- Tips for others

### Example Projects

Looking for inspiration? Check out:
- [Sample Projects](https://github.com/rithum/pika/tree/main/services/samples)
- [Serverless Examples](https://github.com/rithum/pika/tree/main/packages/pika-serverless/examples)
- Community projects shared in discussions

