## How to Get Help Quickly

### 1. Choose the Right Channel

- **Bug or error?** → [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/rithum/pika/issues)
- **Question or discussion?** → [GitHub Discussions](https://github.com/rithum/pika/discussions)
- **Quick question?** → Check [Troubleshooting](/platform/troubleshooting/) first

### 2. Provide Complete Information

When asking for help, include:

```bash
# System information
node --version
pnpm --version
pika --version

# Current version
cat .pika-sync.json | grep pikaVersion

# Error details
# (Include full error message and stack trace)
```

**Environment details:**
- Operating system
- Node.js version
- pnpm version
- Pika version
- AWS region (if relevant)

**Reproduction steps:**
- What you did
- What you expected
- What actually happened

### 3. Search First

Before posting:
- Search [existing issues](https://github.com/rithum/pika/issues)
- Check [GitHub Discussions](https://github.com/rithum/pika/discussions)
- Review [Troubleshooting guide](/platform/troubleshooting/)

